    <briefdescription>
<para>A single adaptive rule loaded from SelfImprovementModule.yaml. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each rule watches one monitoring <computeroutput>metric</computeroutput>, compares it against a <computeroutput>condition</computeroutput> threshold, and applies an <computeroutput>action</computeroutput> (adjusting a config field by <computeroutput>delta</computeroutput>) when the condition is met. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
